---
manual: styles.strokewidth
lines: [1463, 1468]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: D8
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 200 do
  fill white
  @ring = oval left: 50, top: 50, width: 100, height: 80, stroke: black, strokewidth: 6
end
----------- test code
dark = (40..70).count { |x| pixel_at(x, 90).first(3).sum < 200 }
assert_includes 5..7, dark, "a 6 pixel stroke paints about 6 dark pixels across the oval's left edge"
